SOfz7rveCPrKVMprBMVoXOpRrnox-cLKokfviE-dVH3oC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvdyRd5Au7L_ZrAhPmdJb3Ki7SDVAzk2eXp10K5KvJexA&oe=69A2D6F4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fencing-vr Landscape.png", "id": "1105385768373296", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310646_1105385771706629_1526644266772282750_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FlOquFZjKwsQ7kNvwEKKB8E&_nc_oc=AdnW1exa0L-G_JUl1XofzsML3tmZ5wcrpOOOUb0ddyoLVf_RnrZ5dmKPFvvv4t9xWog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsUXlNIUb3cHCi_1T1F79QkwyQ6uVTsxjeWIICQkGpCjA&oe=69A2CA12"}, "display_name": "Fencing VR: En Garde Arena", "keywords": ["Combat", "swords", "duel", "battle", "clash"], "long_description": "Step onto the virtual piste! Experience the world's most elegant combat sport with unparalleled realism in Fencing game.\n\nPowered by a realistic fencing physics , every parry, lunge, and touch\u00e9 feels authentic. Master the blade in a true test of wits, reflexes, and strategy.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\nMASTER 3 DISCIPLINES: Duel against advanced AI opponents in Foil, \u00c9p\u00e9e, and Sabre to perfect your technique in every style.\n\nGLOBAL MULTIPLAYER: Challenge players worldwide in tactical, head-to-head Foil duels, where strategy is everything.\n\nPLAY YOUR WAY: Full support for both immersive, athletic Roomscale VR and accessible, quick-play Stationary VR.\n\n\nHone your skills, find your rhythm, and prove your worth on the piste.", "short_description": "Step onto the virtual piste! Experience intense duels powered by realistic physics and true 1:1 motion tracking where every touch\u00e9 feels real.\n\nChallenge players worldwide in ranked multiplayer, master your technique in the Training Academy, and customize your gear to create a champion.\n\nYour honor is on the line. The Arena awaits. En Garde!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.abstron.com/privacy.html"